asset:        988-style-drop-shadow-switched-off.aep
title:        After Effects project fixture: a Drop Shadow layer style switched off
author:       vangel76 (contributor)
source:       original work
license:      MIT OR Apache-2.0
added:        2026-10-19 by vangel76
notes:        Generated by the contributor with Adobe After Effects 2026 (saved by After Effects from the contributor's case 952 with the style's switch flag set to 0 in a copy) as their own test data for the effectcraft-aep tests; contains only synthetic project structure, no third-party footage (the footage link names a contributor-made test image that is not included; its stored path and host name were replaced by neutral ones of the same length), presets, templates or personal data. No Adobe sample project or asset was used. The project container is byte-identical to the generated file apart from that path; the XMP packet after it was replaced by the (smaller) packet of the base project to keep the fixtures small.
